DESCRIPTION:Join Mutual Aid committee for a skill share!July 26: Pickling\n
 \nJoin Isabella to learn about your nervous system and ways to develop a ca
 lm and regulated existence. When we feel like we’re drowning it’s hard to d
 o anything besides try to survive\, in this skill share\, we’ll cover how t
 o notice when your nervous system is telling you it needs some help (dysreg
 ulation)\, and tools to calm your nervous system and maintain that calm thr
 ough difficult moments. Regulation is for everyone\, capitalism encourages 
 us to be in a state of anxiety and burnout\, and staying calm and regulated
  is a small act of rebellion that increases our capacity.\n\nRSVP: https://
 solidarity.socodsa.org/skill-share
LAST-MODIFIED:20260713T225801Z
LOCATION:Address revealed upon RSVP
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:🧑🏽‍🏫 Skill Share - Nervous System Regulation
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
