 tion\nBring your own bags (if able)\nHave respect for other community membe
 rs\nAsk questions if you have them\nBring large leftover donations home wit
 h you\n\nDon't\n\nDonate dirty or broken items\nTry to barter or sell items
 \nTake anything from the personal item area\nLeave behind trash\nDonate any
  underwear/garments\nDonate large furniture/items\n\n\nRSVP: https://solida
 rity.socodsa.org/really-really-free-market
