 nd/or e-mailed with the information! All doorknocks will be within District
  2 which includes Petaluma\, Penngrove\, Cotati\, and part of Rohnert Park!
 \nIf you're a DSA member\, sign up with the phone number and e-mail associa
 ted your membership so we don't double contact you!\n\nRSVP: https://democr
 atic-socialists-of-america.solidarity.tech/doorknocking-for-joanna-paun-apr
 il-4th
